   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_4ca9a873c579304d3800",
   "sourceHash": "4ca9a873c579304d38003d45c1c69c03ca610df39829d933c8e28ea88e6eb913",
   "text": "Kairali（喀拉拉邦）为面瘫提供由医师指导的阿育吠陀照护，包括 Nasyam、Shirodhara（希罗达拉）等疗法、瑜伽及个体化规划。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_2ba7312865a1bc18653d",
   "sourceHash": "2ba7312865a1bc18653db99cffe8001c58a1ac11fc2b35cfd9655a85831ae99f",
   "text": "Kairali – 阿育吠陀疗愈村提供的面瘫阿育吠陀治疗旨在恢复平衡、调理失调的瓦塔（Vata）。在使用草药减轻面部肿胀和疼痛的同时，医师还会开具片剂、choornam（草药粉）和酥油（ghee）制剂。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
